pkg-1.0.0/manifest.pdxsig -- STUB envelope preview (M5-close)
=============================================================

This file previews the exact bytes `release/1.0/gen-manifest.sh` emits
at M5-close (PDX_STUB_SIG=1 default; v0.33-crypto-kdf substrate gate).
Every offset is annotated with its field name from
`design/manifest-format.md` §4 and `release/1.0/manifest-layout.md` §2-§5.

Byte counts:
  header      =    64 B  (offset 0     .. 63)
  body        =  4477 B  (offset 64    .. 4540)
  sigblock    =  6594 B  (offset 4541  .. 11134)
  total       = 11135 B

Every ASCII run in the STUB fills is a `PDX_*_PENDING_V033-` pattern
truncated to fit the declared length. When v0.33-crypto-kdf lands,
those runs become opaque key/hash/signature bytes and the surrounding
offsets/lengths hold.

