------------------------------------------------------------------
DIFF-FLIP AT v0.33-crypto-kdf UPLIFT
------------------------------------------------------------------

At v0.33-crypto-kdf substrate close, re-run:

    PDX_STUB_SIG=0 release/1.0/gen-manifest.sh build-out/pkg \
                     build-out/pkg-1.0.0

The re-emitted manifest.pdxsig will:

  1. Header offsets 0x18 .. 0x37 (body_sha3 halves) hold real
     sha3-256(body) bytes instead of the PDX_H3 STUB fill.
  2. Body records 5, 6, 8, 9, 11, 12, and every FILE_INVENTORY's
     sha3_256 field hold real key / fingerprint / hash bytes.
  3. Sigblock offsets 0x0004 .. 0x0CE0 and 0x0CE5 .. 0x19C1 hold
     real ML-DSA-65 signature bytes over (header || body).

Every declared length (body_len, sigblock_len, kv_len, path_len)
and every offset stays exactly as pinned in this preview -- the
STUB envelope is the same shape as the release envelope.
